    <briefdescription>
<para>Specialize this to implement &apos;trivial&apos; sequence serialization for a concrete sequence type. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Trivial sequence serialization uses the sequence&apos;s &apos;size&apos; member to get the length of the sequence, and uses a range-based for loop to iterate over the elements.</para>
<para>Specializing this template class means that you do not need to provide a specialization of <ref refid="classllvm_1_1orc_1_1shared_1_1_s_p_s_serialization_traits" kindref="compound">SPSSerializationTraits</ref> for your type. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
